{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop aboard a Fate Train to the Spirit World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange landscapes and stranger characters. But be warned \u2013 the future of this world may very well rest on your knobby little shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/Freeride_gif1_B.gif?t=1746190037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret personality test! Play to the end to see your results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching storyline! (You\u2019ll only see about \u2153 in any playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unforgettable cast of weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dennis the Door is in it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 4 hours per run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/Freeride_gif2_cast_A.gif?t=1746190037\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RIDE THE FATE TRAIN EXPRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a colourful cast of Spirits, each with their own goals, struggles and motivations. Help them resolve their Unfinished Business (or not), and see where each CHOICE leads you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/Freeride_gif3_perso_test.gif?t=1746190037\" />THIS IS A PERSONALITY TEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of Freeride is shaped by your decisions, both Conscious and Unconscious. Go looking for a fight and you\u2019ll find one. Want drama? There\u2019s pllllllenty of that &lt;3\u00a0 Don\u2019t forget! The game is always watching you, and your Personality Outcome awaits at the end.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But no stress, there are no good or bad ways to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597910/extras/Freeride_gif4_action_choices.gif?t=1746190037\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRANCHING STORYLINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On each playthrough you will only see about a third of the full game. Each character helps you explore a facet of your personality, and your subconscious biases will have a real effect on their endings. Make your choices and play through your own adventure, then start a second run and rewrite history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br>--- <br> <br>Psst\u2026 Hey! You! Yes, YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll try the game, won\u2019t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t you want to know Who You Really Are? \u2026Every human does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019ll make you feel better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Promise *P</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ouuuuah~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1597910/e9190b754722272c2dc5032d8e5f5bd46cc946b9.jpg"},{"name":"No.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1597910/e026b49ec4b2b3b7c1eebe07dc345b82f0e1d85c.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Sewer Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1597910/4e736da1dbfaac91a5fee685a89a179fd11b817b.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Inner Rotunda","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1597910/a3fbfc83eb17e68de05e3538f2d41491fa0b43dd.jpg"},{"name":"Found their Apartment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1597910/2d28df7c88ae2c364a02a7250d6e3ba88613070c.jpg"},{"name":"Got past Dennis","path":"https://cdn.akama